  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7e822aad7b61dec47bb7b52e4276192f, type: 3}
  m_Name: B.2.a
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Lines:
  - "Do you remember the \u201Che\u201D she mentioned in her diary?"
  - "That was your mother\u2019s assistant."
  - He worked beside her for years and earned her trust.
  - But over time, he became obsessed with what her invention could bring him.
  - "And then he tried to use his position to steal your mother\u2019s inventions."
  - And he was trying to use this technology to commit the perfect crime, because
    teleportation can create a near-perfect alibi.
  - Your mom is a person of strong principles. And she originally invented this to
    help others, not to harm them.
  - So as soon as she discovered this, she immediately removed him from the project
    and forced him out of the laboratory.
  - And he didn't take it well.
  - At the same time, your mother knew he would never simply walk away.
  - "But you know, your mom is such a kind person, so she wouldn\u2019t hurt her
    assistant any further."
  - But she also worried that you might get dragged into this and get hurt.
  ReplyOptions:
  - line: ...So she chose to leave me.
